# Project Title: Yes/No Quiz 

## Description

This folder has a main script that is used to create a program which illustrates how to create and use a class. 

This folder also contains a secondary folder called "quiz-game-start" which has a program for a yes/no quiz game. The quiz is a 12 
question quiz and runs until all questions are asked and spits out the final score once done.

### Dependencies

Mandatory: 

KEY POINTS:
1. The data.py file stores all the questions and their answers.
2. The main.py calls all functions in the question_model and quiz_brain classes.
3. The "quiz_brain" class does most of the heavy lifting.
4. The questions are selected at random and every try.

### Installations Needed

random library

